          "type": "title",
          "text": "The lamp is lit. The Unwriter is gone."
        },
        {
          "type": "line",
          "line": {
            "speaker": "npc",
            "text": "The Scribe came here three nights ago.\nWrote something on my wall. Look.",
            "name": "The Lamplighter"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "title",
          "text": "The Scribe is in another buffer."
        },
        {
          "type": "line",
          "line": {
            "speaker": "npc",
            "text": "Means nothing to me. Maybe to you.\nThe road goes on, past the sea.",
            "name": "The Lamplighter"
          }
        },
